  <b>ONE CONFIGURATION: END OF DAY PRICING</b>
  Approved - Official for End of day - version 4 - AMC - Editable
  [ Propose a change ]
  A proposed version 5 waits for sign-off. 1 of 3 roles have approved. Version 4 stays in force.
  [ Open the sign-off ]
  [ Details ] | [ Products ] | [ Parameters ] | [ Reports ] | [ History ]
  --
  Coverage: the reports that bind it need 11 product types, and 11 have a row here.
  {#
    Report | Cycle | Needs | Priced here | Runs with
    Group Consolidated Exposure | End of day | 11 | Covered | version 4
    Large Exposures | End of day | 5 | Covered | version 4
